### 安全云盘系统 - API测试文件
### 使用说明：点击每个请求前的绿色三角形按钮即可发送请求

### ========================================
### 1. 测试接口（无需认证）
### ========================================
GET http://localhost:8080/api/auth/test


POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/send-code
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "599978009@qq.com",
  "codeType": 1
}

### ========================================
### 3. 用户注册
### 注意：
### 1. 将邮箱改成你的邮箱
### 2. 将verificationCode改成你收到的6位验证码
### ========================================
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "email": "599978009@qq.com",
  "password": "123456",
  "confirmPassword": "123456",
  "verificationCode": "123456"
}

### ========================================
### 4. 发送登录验证码
### 注意：将邮箱改成你的邮箱
### ========================================
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/send-code
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "your_email@qq.com",
  "codeType": 2
}

### ========================================
### 5. 用户登录
### 注意：
### 1. 将邮箱改成你的邮箱
### 2. 将verificationCode改成你收到的6位验证码
### ========================================
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "your_email@qq.com",
  "password": "123456",
  "verificationCode": "123456"
}

### ========================================
### 测试示例：带认证的请求
### 注意：将下面的token替换为登录后获得的实际token
### ========================================
GET http://localhost:8080/api/user/info
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9...你的token...

###
